,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-27T17:10:01Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T23:13:37Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.3, 4.4.1, 4.5 beta 6\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 5 7600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n`snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel` setting for viewports causes `Line2D` nodes to render round endcaps with pixel-sized holes between the cap and the actual line. Easiest to see when rotating the `Line2D`. Box endcaps and round joints do not seem to have any issue. The size of the `Line2D` does not appear to matter.\n\n<img width=\"550\" height=\"373\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/319a720a-4c3d-488b-acb0-f0ecb7d592c3\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download MRP.\n2. Press up and down to rotate the Line2D for holes to flicker in and out of view.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n\n[mrp-line2d-vertexsnap.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22010733/mrp-line2d-vertexsnap.zip)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110030/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110030/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}